 15th<\/strong><\/p>","button_label":"SHOP YOGA MATS","button_link":"shopify:\/\/collections\/yoga-mats","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"right","divider":false}},"adfb2e49-8ee1-480d-ae89-588ee8cdf986":{"type":"text-and-image","disabled":true,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Day3_084cbefb-f25d-456a-9e3c-525d2668d5c8.jpg","image_width":500,"subtitle":"December 16Th","title":"20% off Sport Mats","text":"<p>Stable and versatile mats that allow for easy setup and various skill training exercises<\/p><p><strong>Use Code: XMAS3<\/strong><\/p><p><strong>Date Available: December 16th<\/strong><\/p>","button_label":"SHOP SPORTS MATS","button_link":"shopify:\/\/pages\/sport-mats","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"left","divider":false}},"1f9d88e1-2538-4327-96b3-6b9924fb74bb":{"type":"text-and-image","disabled":true,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Day-4-PNG_b1c64db8-bf03-44fc-8941-f7bd30b6e3fc.png","image_width":500,"subtitle":"December 17th","title":"30% off Floor Defender","text":"<p>Floor Defender Garage Containment Mats protect your garage against snow, mud, ice, and oil preventing cracks and improving the longevity of your floors<\/p><p><strong>Use Code: XMAS4<\/strong><\/p><p><strong>Date Available: December 17th<\/strong><\/p>","button_label":"SHOP FLOOR DEFENDER","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/floor-defender-garage-containment-mats","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"right","divider":false}},"492c09c6-f81f-421e-a6dd-c07876d45cad":{"type":"text-and-image","disabled":true,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Day5_b012f340-7ff9-4354-aca8-f257c0bae4a4.jpg","image_width":500,"subtitle":"DECEMBER 18th","title":"30% off Personalized Doormats","text":"<p>Our mats come in two quality options. The thick premium handwoven coco doormats and slip resistant vinyl backed<\/p><p><strong>Use Code: XMAS5<\/strong><\/p><p><strong>Date Available: December 18th<\/strong><\/p>","button_l